<title>USA: Biosource sets buyback up to 200,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Biosource sets buyback up to 200,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CAMARILLO, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioSource International Inc on Tuesday said its board of directors has approved a plan to repurchase up to 200,000 of its common shares.</p>
<p>The plan is approved to April 30, 1998.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said its decision was based on the company's stock price, which closed today up 5/16 at 6-15/16. BioSource also said repurchased shares might also be used in future acquisitions.</p>
</text>
